the maximum size is 4.

commands.description:
This command lets you set the speciﬁc video line number to be used for triggering
on a video signal. You must also use the TRIGger:A:VIDeo{:SYNC|:FIELD}
command to specify NUMERic as the video ﬁeld to use.

